{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"评价之辩","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-or-mysticism","title":"哲学还是玄学之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/philosophy-or-mysticism","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"applicability-debate","title":"适用性之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/applicability-debate","wordCount":1417,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"评价之辩\">评价之辩</h1><p>本章呈现围绕稻盛和夫思想的评价之辩。稻盛和夫强调&quot;心&quot;之力量的理念，引发了&quot;哲学还是玄学&quot;的争辩；其特定的文化背景，则引发了关于适用性的思考。两篇文档，分别呈现哲学还是玄学之辩，以及适用性之辩，力求辩证而平衡。</p>\n"}